  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1258",
    "issue_date": "2026-07-24T02:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-24T08:16:13.599Z",
    "meteorologist": "Sanjib Adhikari",
    "analysis_np": "हाल देशभर मनसुनी वायूको प्रभाव रहेको छ। हाल मनसुनको न्यून चापीय रेखा नेपालको पश्चिम भू-भागमा सरदर भन्दा उत्तरतर्फ तथा पूर्वी भू-भागमा सरदर स्थानको आसपासमा रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "The country is currently under the influence of the monsoon winds. At present, the monsoon trough lies slightly north of its normal position over the western part of Nepal, while it remains near its normal position over the eastern part of the country.",
    "today_np": "देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भूभागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागमा पनि साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । मधेश र कोशी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराईका थोरै स्थान तथा मधेश र कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका पहाडी भू-भाग तथा बागमती, गण्डकी र कर्णाली प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागको एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions. Generally cloudy conditions are also likely over the Terai region of Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, and Sudurpashchim Provinces, while the Terai region of Madhesh and Koshi Provinces will remain partly cloudy There is a possibility of light to moderate rain/thundershowers at some places of the Hilly and Himalayan regions. There is also a possibility of light to moderate rain with thunder and lightning at a few places of the Terai region of Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and at one or two places of the Terai region of Madhesh and Koshi Provinces. There is a possibility of heavy rainfall at one or two places of the Hilly region of Lumbini Province and the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, and Karnali Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भूभागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ र तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराईका थोरै स्थान तथा मधेश र कोशी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions, while the Terai region will remain partly cloudy. There is a possibility of light to moderate rain/thundershowers at a few places of the Hilly and Himalayan regions. There is also a possibility of light to moderate rain with thunder and lightning at a few places of the Terai region of Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and at one or two places of the Terai region of Madhesh and Koshi Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
